      "path": "parsed\\facecraft\\images\\figure_004.png",
      "caption": "Figure 3. Image Prior: We introduce a cross-view mutual attention mechanism and epipolar constraints to enhance consistency in generated novel views. Our approach aligns reference and target images, maintaining visual coherence across viewpoints.",
